<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Classification of the Functions of Government (COFOG) </prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-09-10</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-08-27</created>
	<creator xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xml:lang="en">United Nations Statistics Division (UNSD)</creator>
	<description xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xml:lang="en">The Classification of Functions of Government (COFOG) is regarded as the appropriate basis to examine the structure of government expenditure; it is one of four functional classifications commonly used in national accounts. COFOG is a 3-level classification with 10 'divisions' at the top level, each of which is broken down into between 6 and 9 'groups' at the next level of detail, which in turn are partly sub-divided further into 'classes'. COFOG 2nd level data were included as a requirement in the ESA 2010 transmission programme (Annex B of Regulation of the European Parliament and of the Council (EU) No. 549/2013). By 2013, all 28 EU Member States and three EFTA countries were already in a position to provide COFOG 2nd level data. </description>
	<versionInfo xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#">1999</versionInfo>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pt">(SC) e (SI) designam, respetivamente, os serviços coletivos e os serviços individuais.
n.e.: abreviatura de não especificado.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lt">(KP) ir (IP) – atitinkamai reiškia kolektyvines paslaugas ir individualias paslaugas.
n. k. n. – niekur kitur nepriskirta.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">(CS) and (IS) denote collective services and individual services respectively.
n.e.c.: abbreviation for not elsewhere classified.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ro">(CS) și (IS) desemnează servicii colective și, respectiv, servicii individuale.
n.c.a: abreviere pentru neclasificate altundeva.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="de">(CS) und (IS) kennzeichnen kollektive bzw. individuelle Dienstleistungen.
a.n.g.: Abkürzung für „anderweitig nicht genannt“.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">A (KSZ) és (ESZ) rövidítések a közösségi, illetve az egyéni szolgáltatásokat jelölik.
M. n. s.: máshová nem sorolt.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hr">(CS) i (IS) označavaju kolektivne usluge i individualne usluge.
d.n.: kratica za drugdje nespomenuto.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="nl">(CD) en (ID) staan respectievelijk voor collectieve diensten en individuele diensten.
n.e.g.: afkorting voor niet elders genoemd.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="et">(KT) ja (IT) märgivad vastavalt „kollektiivseid teenuseid“ ja „individuaalseid teenuseid“.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sk">(KS) označujú „kolektívne služby“ a (IS) „individuálne služby“.
i. n.: skratka pre „inde neklasifikované“.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sv">Med (KT) och (IT) avses kollektiva tjänster respektive individuella tjänster.
Med “övriga“ avses tjänster som inte är klassificerade någon annanstans.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">(SC) et (SI) dénotent respectivement les services collectifs et les services individuels.
n.c.a. est l'abréviation de “non classé ailleurs“.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pl">Skróty „(UO)” i „(UI)” oznaczają odpowiednio usługi ogólnospołeczne i usługi indywidualne.
„g.i.n.”: skrót oznaczający „gdzie indziej niesklasyfikowany/-a/-e”.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ga">Is do sheirbhísí comhchoiteanna a sheasann (SC), agus is do sheirbhísí aonair a sheasann (SA).
n.e.c.: abbreviation for not elsewhere classified.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="cs">(KS) a (IS) označují kolektivní služby a individuální služby
j. n.: zkratka pro jinde neuvedené.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="es">SC y SI significan servicio colectivo y servicio particular, respectivamente.
n.e.p.: es la abreviatura de “no especificados en otra partida”.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="mt">(CS, collective services) u (IS, individual services) jindikaw servizzi kollettivi u servizzi individwali rispettivament.
n.e.c. (not elsewhere classified): abbrevjazzjoni għal “mhux ikklassifikati xi mkien ieħor”.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="da">(KT) og (IT) betegner henholdsvis kollektive tjenester og individuelle tjenester.
i.a.n.: forkortelse for ikke andetsteds nævnt.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fi">(KP) ja (YP) tarkoittavat kollektiivisia palveluja ja yksilöllisiä palveluja.
m.l.: lyhenne ”muualla luokittelematon”.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sl">(KS) pomeni kolektivne storitve, (IS) pomeni individualne storitve,
d. n. pomeni drugje nerazvrščeno.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="el">Οι συντομογραφίες «ΣΥ» και «ΑΥ» σημαίνουν «συλλογικές υπηρεσίες» και «ατομικές υπηρεσίες» αντίστοιχα.
π.δ.κ.α.: συντομογραφία της φράσης «που δεν κατατάσσεται αλλού».</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="bg">С „(КУ)“ и „(ИУ)“ се обозначават съответно колективните услуги и индивидуалните услуги.
Съкращението „н.к.д.“ означава „некласифицирани другаде“.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="it">(SC) e (SI) indicano rispettivamente “servizio collettivo“ e “servizio individuale“.
n.c.a.: è l'abbreviazione di “non classificato altrove“.</note>
	<note xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lv">(KP) un (IP) apzīmē attiecīgi kolektīvos pakalpojumus un individuālos pakalpojumus.
c. n.: saīsinājums “citur neklasificēts”.</note>
	<issued xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-12-11</issued>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog</identifier>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog/09.2.2">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
	<broader xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog/09.2"/>
