	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sv">FoU allmän offentlig förvaltning</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="bg">Приложни научни изследвания в областта на общофункционалното управление на държавата</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="nl">O&amp;O op het gebied van algemeen overheidsbestuur</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ro">Servicii publice generale C&amp;D</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">Általános közszolgáltatásokkal kapcsolatos K+F</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">R&amp;D General public services</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">01.5</identifier>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Applied research is original investigation undertaken in order to acquire new knowledge, but directed primarily towards a specific practical aim or objective.
Experimental development is systematic work, drawing on existing knowledge gained from research and practical experience, that is directed to producing new materials, products and devices; to installing new processes, systems and services; or to improving substantially those already produced or installed.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

