	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sl">Rekreacijske in športne storitve (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">Services récréatifs et sportifs (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pt">Serviços recreativos e desportivos (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="et">Vabaaja- ja sporditeenused (IT)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="cs">Rekreační a sportovní služby (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="da">Fritids- og sportstjenester (IT)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fi">Virkistys- ja urheilupalvelut (YP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sk">Rekreačné a športové služby (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ro">Servicii recreative și sportive (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="it">Servizi ricreativi e sportivi (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lv">Atpūtas un sporta pakalpojumi (IP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="bg">Услуги в областта на развлеченията и спорта (ИУ)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">Szabadidős és sportolási szolgáltatások (ESZ)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Recreational and sporting services (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="nl">Diensten op het gebied van sport en recreatie (ID)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lt">Poilsio ir sporto paslaugos (IP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="es">Servicios recreativos y deportivos (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ca">Serveis recreatius i esportius (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="mt">Servizzi rikreattivi u sportivi (IS)</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">08.1.0</identifier>
	<exclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Zoological or botanical gardens, aquaria, arboreta and similar institutions (08.20); sporting and recreational facilities associated with educational institutions (classified to the appropriate class of Division 09.).</exclusionNote>
	<inclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Facilities for spectator accommodation; national, regional or local team representation in sporting events.</inclusionNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Provision of sporting and recreational services; administration of sporting and recreational affairs; supervision and regulation of sporting facilities;
− operation or support of facilities for active sporting pursuits or events (playing fields tennis courts, squash courts, running tracks, golf courses, boxing rings, skating rinks, gymnasia, etc.); operation or support of facilities for passive sporting pursuits or events (chiefly specially equipped venues for playing cards, board games, etc.); operation or support of facilities for recreational pursuits (parks, beaches, camping grounds and associated lodging places furnished on a _on-commercial basis, swimming pools, public baths for washing, etc.);
− grants, loans or subsidies to support teams or individual competitors or players.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

