	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ca">Recerca i desenvolupament relacionats amb l'ordre públic i la seguretat</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="nl">O&amp;O op het gebied van openbare orde en veiligheid</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">03.5</identifier>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Definitions of basic research, applied research and experimental development are given under (01.4) and (01.5).</definition>
