− grants, loans or subsidies to support the operation, construction, maintenance or upgrading of such systems.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog/05.2">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
	<broader xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog/05"/>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lt">Nutekamųjų vandenų tvarkyba</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sk">Nakladanie s odpadovými vodami</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ro">Gestionarea apelor uzate</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fi">Jätevesihuolto</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pt">Gestão de águas residuais</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Waste water management</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="de">Abwasserwirtschaft</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sl">Ravnanje z odpadno vodo</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lv">Notekūdeņu apsaimniekošana</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="da">Spildevandshåndtering</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">Szennyvízkezelés</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hr">Gospodarenje otpadnim vodama</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="es">Ordenación de aguas residuales</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ca">Gestió d'aigües residuals</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="it">Gestione delle acque reflue</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pl">Gospodarka ściekami</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="mt">Immaniġġjar tal-ilma mormi</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="cs">Odstraňování odpadních vod</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="et">Heitveekäitlus</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="el">Διαχείριση λυμάτων</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sv">Hantering av avloppsvatten</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="nl">Afvalwaterbeheer</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">Gestion des eaux usées</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="bg">Управление на отпадъчните води</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ga">Bainistiú fuíolluisce</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">05.2</identifier>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">This group covers sewage system operation and waste water treatment.
Sewage system operation includes management and construction of the system of collectors, pipelines, conduits and pumps to evacuate any waste water (rainwater, domestic and other available waste water) from the points of generation to either a sewage treatment plant or to a point where waste water is
discharged to surface water.
Waste water treatment includes any mechanical, biological or advanced process to render waste water fit to meet applicable environment standards or other quality norms.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/7yx/cofog/04.9.0">
