	<exclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Other general services connected with a specific function (classified according to function).</exclusionNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration and operation of other general services such as centralized supply and purchasing services, maintenance and storage of government records and archives, operation of government owned or occupied buildings, central motor vehicle pools, government operated printing offices, centralized computer and data processing services, etc.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

