	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lt">Religinių ir kitų bendruomenių paslaugos (KP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">Hitéleti és egyéb közösségi szolgáltatások (KSZ)</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">08.4.0</identifier>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration of religious and other community affairs;
− provision of facilities for religious and other community services, including support for their operation, maintenance and repair;
− payment of clergy or other officers of religious institutions; support for the holding of religious services; grants, loans or subsidies to support fraternal, civic, youth and social organizations or labour unions and political parties.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

