	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration of military aid and operation of military aid missions accredited to foreign governments or attached to international military organizations or alliances;
− military aid in the form of grants (in cash or in kind), loans (regardless of interest charged) or loans of equipment; contributions to international peacekeeping forces including the assignment of manpower.</definition>
