	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">04.7.3</identifier>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration of tourism affairs and services; promotion and development of tourism; liaison with the transport, hotel and restaurant industries and other industries benefiting from the presence of tourists;
− operation of tourist offices at home and abroad, etc.; organization of advertising campaigns, including the production and dissemination of promotional literature and the like;
− compilation and publication of statistics on tourism.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

