	<inclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Administrative tribunals, ombudsmen and the like.</inclusionNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration, operation or support of civil and criminal law courts and the judicial system, including enforcement of fines and legal settlements imposed by the courts and operation of parole and probation systems;
− legal representation and advice on behalf of government or on behalf of others provided by government in cash or in services.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

