	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration of street lighting affairs; development and regulation of street lighting standards;
− installation, operation, maintenance, upgrading, etc. of street lighting.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

