	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ca">Presons (SC)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">Administration pénitentiaire (SC)</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">03.4.0</identifier>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration, operation or support of prisons and other places for the detention or rehabilitation of criminals such as prison farms, workhouses, reformatories, borstals, asylums for the criminally insane, etc.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

