	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pt">Serviços médicos gerais (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="nl">Algemene medische diensten (ID)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lt">Bendrosios medicinos paslaugos (IP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="da">Almen lægehjælp (IT)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fi">Perusterveydenhuollon palvelut (YP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sv">Allmän hälso- och sjukvård (IT)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">Általános orvosi ellátás (ESZ)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="es">Servicios médicos generales (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ca">Serveis mèdics generals (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">General medical services (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sl">Splošne zdravstvene storitve (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ro">Servicii medicale generale (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="el">Γενικές ιατρικές υπηρεσίες (ΑΥ)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hr">Opće medicinske usluge (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="mt">Servizzi mediċi ġenerali (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">Services de médecine générale (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pl">Ogólne usługi medyczne (UI)</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">07.2.1</identifier>
	<exclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Services of medical analysis laboratories and x-ray centres (07.2.4).</exclusionNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">This class covers the services provided by general medical clinics and general medical practitioners.
General medical clinics are defined as institutions which chiefly provide outpatient services which are not limited to a particular medical speciality and which are chiefly delivered by qualified medical doctors. General medical practitioners do not specialize in a particular medical speciality.
− Provision of general medical services;
− administration, inspection, operation or support of general medical services delivered by general medical clinics and general medical practitioners.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

