	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ga">Cabhair eacnamaíoch do thíortha atá i mbéal forbartha agus do thíortha idir dhá ré (SC)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">Aide économique aux pays en développement ou en transition (SC)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">A fejlődő és az átalakulóban lévő országoknak nyújtott gazdasági támogatás (KSZ)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="cs">Ekonomická pomoc rozvojovým zemím a zemím v procesu transformace (KS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="et">Majandusabi arengu- ja üleminekuriikidele (KT)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lv">Ekonomiskā palīdzība jaunattīstības valstīm un pārejas valstīm (KP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hr">Ekonomska pomoć zemljama u razvoju i zemljama u tranziciji (CS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Economic aid to developing countries and countries in transition (CS)</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">01.2.1</identifier>
	<exclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Contributions to economic development funds administered by international or regional organizations (01.2.2); military aid to foreign countries (02.3.0).</exclusionNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration of economic cooperation with developing countries and countries in transition;
− operation of economic aid missions accredited to foreign governments; operation or support of technical assistance programmes, training programmes and fellowship and scholarship schemes;
− economic aid in the form of grants (in cash or in kind) or loans (regardless of interest charged).</definition>
</rdf:Description>

