	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="cs">Služby sanatorií, kojeneckých ústavů, zotavoven a léčeben pro dlouhodobě nemocné apod. (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="mt">Servizzi ta’ djar tal-kura u tal-konvalexxenza (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sv">Sjukhems- och konvalescenthemsvård (IT)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sk">Iná ústavná zdravotná starostlivosť (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">Ápolás és gondozás (ESZ)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hr">Usluge domova za starije i rehabilitacijskih centara (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="el">Υπηρεσίες οίκων ευγηρίας και κέντρων ανάρρωσης και αποκατάστασης</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Nursing and convalescent home services (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pl">Usługi placówek opiekuńczo-pielęgnacyjnych i rehabilitacyjnych (UI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="nl">Diensten van verpleeghuizen en revalidatiecentra (ID)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lt">Slaugos ir medicininės reabilitacijos namų paslaugos (IP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="et">Hooldekodude ja sanatooriumide teenused (IT)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="sl">Storitve negovanja in okrevanja na domu (IS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fi">Hoito- ja toipilaskotien palvelut (YP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ga">Seirbhísí tí altranais agus tí téarnaimh (SA)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="it">Servizi di case di riposo e case di convalescenza (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="pt">Serviços de enfermagem e casas de convalescença</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="es">Servicios de residencias de la tercera edad y residencias de convalecencia (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ca">Serveis de residències de la tercera edat i de convalescència (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="lv">Aprūpes un rehabilitācijas namu pakalpojumi (IP)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">Services des maisons de repos et des maisons de santé (SI)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ro">Servicii ale centrelor de îngrijire și de convalescență (IS)</prefLabel>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">07.3.4</identifier>
	<inclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Institutions serving old people in which medical monitoring is an essential component; rehabilitation centres providing in-patient health care and rehabilitative therapy where the objective is to treat the patient rather than to provide long-term support.</inclusionNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Nursing and convalescent homes provide in-patient services to persons recovering from surgery or a debilitating disease or condition that requires chiefly monitoring and administering of medicaments, physiotherapy and training to compensate for loss of function or rest.
− Provision of nursing and convalescent home services;
− administration, inspection, operation or support of nursing and convalescent home services.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

