	<exclusionNote xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" xml:lang="en">Forest management (04.2.2); wind and solar heat (04.3.5) or (04.3.6); geothermal resources (04.3.6).</exclusionNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration of affairs and services involving fuels such as alcohol, wood and wood wastes, bagasse and other non-commercial fuels;
