	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">− Administration and operation of government agencies engaged in applied research and experimental development related to mining, manufacturing and construction;
− grants, loans or subsidies to support applied research and experimental development related to mining, manufacturing and construction undertaken by non-government bodies such as research institutes and universities.</definition>
</rdf:Description>

