	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="fr">R-D concernant l’agriculture, la sylviculture, la pêche et la chasse (SC)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">R&amp;D Agriculture, forestry, fishing and hunting (CS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ro">C&amp;D Agricultură, silvicultură, pescuit și vânătoare (CS)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="hu">Mezőgazdasági, erdészeti, halászati és vadászati K+F (KSZ)</prefLabel>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="ga">Taighde agus forbairt—Talmhaíocht, foraoiseacht, iascaireacht agus sealgaireacht (SC)</prefLabel>
